        {
          "number": 2,
          "id": "step-2",
          "heading": "Brown the chicken",
          "blocks": [
            "Heat a drizzle of oil in a large saucepan over medium-high. Lay the chicken flat, season and fry for 4–5 minutes per side until browned. Add the sweet potato, chipotle paste to taste, oregano and garlic. Stir-fry for 1 minute."
          ],
          "notes": [],
          "timers": [
