        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "id": "step-3",
          "heading": "Simmer the chicken",
          "blocks": [
            "Stir in the red wine vinegar, half the stock paste, half the mint, {{sugar}} sugar and {{sauce-water}} water. Bring to the boil and reduce to medium. Simmer for 20–25 minutes until the sauce thickens and the chicken is cooked through."
          ],
          "notes": [],
          "timers": [
            {
