        {
          "number": 4,
          "id": "step-4",
          "heading": "Cook the bulgur",
          "blocks": [
            "Bring {{bulgur-water}} water and the rest of the stock paste to a boil in a second saucepan. Stir in the bulgur, bring back to a boil and simmer for 1 minute. Cover, take off the heat and leave for 12–15 minutes."
          ],
          "notes": [],
